      "text": "Family hx:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " comprehensive FHx @ the 1 mo visit; if this = the first visit, a detailed family, preg, delivery and initial newborn care Hx = needed."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
