       }
      ],
      "text": "ROS — concerns about:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " head shape; eye d/c; ears, nose and throat; breathing; vomiting or spitting, BMs, umbilical stump; genitals or rectum; skin; development (musc strength, mvt of arms or legs, develop concerns)."
     }
